  "prefLabel": "Pda 502.21 Open to the general public",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 502.21 “Open to the general public” means that any person is allowed the use of facilities with or without the payment of a fee or other consideration, subject to applicable health and safety restrictions.\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; renumbered by #8775 (from Pda 502.21); ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (formerly Pda 502.24) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
